.TH PLL 1
.SH NAME
pll \\- lint XML property lists
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pll
pll FILE ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lints plist XML and flags malformed or risky launchd logic without loading the plist.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBpll --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
